1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,879
We all know gangmastering — but how do you dismantle a mafia system if the victims are invisible?

2
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:10,120
Without testimony from the inside, prosecutors have their hands tied.

3
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,679
Take a tomato field in Puglia.

4
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:17,120
Undocumented farmworkers are exploited in absolute silence.

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,879
Why don't they report it?

6
00:00:18,879 --> 00:00:23,160
For an irregular worker, speaking up doesn't just mean losing pay.

7
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:27,519
It means facing the near-certain risk of being expelled from Italy.

8
00:00:27,519 --> 00:00:29,199
It was a perfect trap.

9
00:00:29,359 --> 00:00:33,679
Until the FLAI union entered those fields and changed the rules.

10
00:00:33,679 --> 00:00:37,879
They brought not only solidarity, but a formidable legal weapon.

11
00:00:37,879 --> 00:00:41,519
They offered the one thing that could break the blackmail.

12
00:00:41,519 --> 00:00:46,159
A temporary document that protects from deportation those who report exploitation.

13
00:00:46,159 --> 00:00:49,560
The law calls it a humanitarian residence permit.

14
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,679
The balance of terror snaps.

15
00:00:51,679 --> 00:00:55,879
With the guarantee of a secure status, the fear of expulsion vanishes.

16
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:58,480
Farmworkers cross their arms, name names,

17
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:00,920
and hand the evidence to prosecutors.

18
00:01:00,920 --> 00:01:03,280
With key witnesses finally safe,

19
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:06,760
the state has the legal basis for mass whistleblowing

20
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:09,000
and to crack down on agro-mafias on the ground.

21
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,920
The criminal system cracks from the inside.

22
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:15,320
And that Puglia tomato field, once a clan stronghold,

23
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:17,760
is reborn today as an agricultural cooperative.

24
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:20,454
Worked, at last, by free men.
